{
  "sections": {
    "hero_colour_last": {
      "type": "montibello-image-banner",
      "blocks": {},
      "block_order": [],
      "name": "Banner Montibello",
      "settings": {
        "layout": "full",
        "section_width": "full-width",
        "bundled_image": "montibello-hop-colour-last-hero.jpg",
        "image_alt": "Montibello HOP Colour Last — Shampoo, Rinse y Mask",
        "toggle_overlay": false,
        "padding-block-start": 0,
        "padding-block-end": 0
      }
    },
    "intro_colour_last": {
      "type": "section",
      "blocks": {
        "intro_group": {
          "type": "group",
          "settings": {
            "content_direction": "column",
            "width": "custom",
            "custom_width": 50,
            "width_mobile": "fill",
            "height": "fit"
          },
          "blocks": {
            "heading": {
              "type": "text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<h1>Colour Last</h1>",
                "type_preset": "h1",
                "max_width": "none"
              }
            },
            "text": {
              "type": "text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>Rutina hidratante y protectora que prolonga la vida del color en los cabellos coloreados. Enriquecida con Ácido ferúlico, un potente antioxidante de origen vegetal con alto poder hidratante que protege de los radicales libres y de la radiación solar y prolonga la duración del color y del brillo.</p>",
                "type_preset": "rte",
                "max_width": "none"
              }
            }
          },
          "block_order": ["heading", "text"]
        }
      },
      "block_order": ["intro_group"],
      "name": "Sección",
      "settings": {
        "section_width": "page-width",
        "background_color": "{{ settings.color_palette.background }}",
        "padding-block-start": 25,
        "padding-block-end": 0
      }
    },
    "range_title_styles": {
      "type": "montibello-range-title",
      "settings": {}
    },
    "results_colour_last": {
      "type": "montibello-stats-panel",
      "blocks": {
        "heading": {
          "type": "text",
          "static": true,
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h2>Protección y cuidado para el cabello coloreado.</h2>",
            "type_preset": "h2",
            "max_width": "normal"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [],
      "name": "Panel de datos Colour Last",
      "settings": {
        "bundled_image": "montibello-hop-colour-last-results.webp",
        "image_alt": "Montibello HOP Colour Last — protección del color",
        "media_position": "left",
        "toggle_label": "Ver datos",
        "stat_1_number": "8 semanas",
        "stat_1_label": "de color protegido",
        "stat_2_number": "x6",
        "stat_2_label": "cabello más resistente a rotura*",
        "stat_3_number": "",
        "stat_3_label": "Crea un escudo protector antioxidante y anti-polución para preservar el color",
        "stat_4_number": "",
        "stat_4_label": "Filtro UV",
        "footnote": "*test instrumental",
        "bundled_file": "none",
        "file_label": "",
